    RIGHT


Grammar

    0 $accept: function $end

    1 function: function_header optional_variable body

    2 function_header: FUNCTION IDENTIFIER optional_parameters RETURNS type ';'

    3 parameters: parameter more_parameters

    4 more_parameters: ',' parameter more_parameters
    5                | ε

    6 parameter: IDENTIFIER ':' type

    7 optional_parameters: parameters
    8                    | ε

    9 type: INTEGER
   10     | REAL
   11     | CHARACTER

   12 optional_variable: variable
   13                  | ε

   14 variable: IDENTIFIER ':' type IS statement ';'
   15         | IDENTIFIER ':' LIST OF type IS list ';'

   16 list: '(' expressions ')'

   17 expressions: expressions ',' expression
   18            | expression

   19 body: BEGIN_ statement_ END ';'

   20 statement_: statement ';'
   21           | error ';'

   22 statement: expression
   23          | WHEN condition ',' expression ':' expression
   24          | SWITCH expression IS cases OTHERS ARROW statement ';' ENDSWITCH
   25          | if_statement

   26 if_statement: IF condition THEN statement_ elsif_clauses ENDIF
   27             | IF condition THEN statement_ elsif_clauses ELSE statement_ ENDIF

   28 elsif_clauses: ε
   29              | ELSIF condition THEN statement_ elsif_clauses

   30 cases: cases case
   31      | ε

   32 case: CASE INT_LITERAL ARROW statement ';'

   33 condition: condition ANDOP relation
   34          | relation

   35 relation: '(' condition ')'
   36         | expression RELOP expression

   37 expression: expression ADDOP term
   38           | term

   39 term: term MULOP primary
   40     | primary

   41 primary: '(' expression ')'
   42        | INT_LITERAL
   43        | CHAR_LITERAL
   44        | REAL_LITERAL
   45        | IDENTIFIER '(' expression ')'
   46        | IDENTIFIER


